     {
      "q": "Can two people book the whole boat?",
      "a": "Yes. The price is per boat, not per person, so a couple pays the same <strong>€225</strong> as a group of 20. Guests regularly book it for two."
     },
     {
      "q": "Are drinks included?",
      "a": "No. The bar on board sells drinks and snacks at your own cost, and bringing your own food or drinks is not allowed."
     },
     {
      "q": "Can we sail after dark?",
      "a": "Only early in winter: in mid-November the latest start on the calendar was 16:00, so plan around sunset."
     },
     {
      "q": "Is there a guide on board?",
      "a": "No. It is a slow sightseeing loop between Margaret Bridge and Elisabeth Bridge with a sound system, but no commentary."
     },
     {
      "q": "How do we get to Dock 42?",
      "a": "Take tram 2, 4 or 6 to Jászai Mari tér, then walk about 500 metres north along the river to the Dock 42 sign. It is north of Margaret Bridge, further out than the central piers."
